pick_one: Which city is the capital of Canada?
!<analysis>[Why?](Toronto is the largest city, which is why it's the usual wrong guess — but Ottawa was chosen in 1857 precisely because it sat on the border between Upper and Lower Canada.)
{
=Ottawa
~Toronto
~Vancouver
~Montreal
}

